ted its financial results", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1769628/000176962826000461/crwv-20261110.htm", "form": "8-K", "cik": 1769628, "accession": "0001769628-26-000461", "attached": true}]}, "mood": {"label": "Fear", "score": 14.351851851851855, "day": "2026-11-13", "vix": 19.3, "fear": 79.1005291005291, "heat": 7.804232804232805, "proof": "Context only: in the test, the mood didn't predict the market's returns."}, "mood_allowed": {"Fear": false, "Greed": false}, "site_url": "https://brief-vvr1sffwuc.github.io/", "big_move": 0.05, "today": "2026-11-17", "coming": [{"day": "2026-11-17", "what": "Nvidia is expected to report its results", "ticker": "NVDA"}, {"day": "2026-11-23", "what": "Hewlett Packard Enterprise is expected to report its results", "ticker": "HPE"}, {"day": "2026-11-24", "what": "Dell Technologies is expected to report its results", "ticker": "DELL"}, {"day": "2026-12-01", "what": "Credo Technology is expected to report its results", "ticker": "CRDO"}, {"day": "2026-12-01", "what": "Marvell Technology is expected to report its results", "ticker": "MRVL"}], "short": {"AMD": "All the articles are opinion pieces, and they give mixed signals about AMD. They cite strong data center growth and a Google Cloud EPYC chip deal, but also a stock drop after new chip export restrictions on Southeast Asia, where Singapore made up 12.4% of 2025 revenue. They disagree on direction and valuation: one says shares rallied 19%, another says they fell 8.75% after earnings.", "NVDA": "Nvidia co-founder Jensen Huang resigned as CEO on Nov. 12 amid allegations of an affair with an alleged Chinese spy tied to chip diversions to China, and CFO Colette Kress is interim CEO. The stock has fallen about 30% from its October peak, and a federal investigation and China revenue risk are in focus ahead of Nov. 17 earnings. All articles are opinion pieces, and they disagree on whether the drop is overdone."}, "chosen": [], "alert_days": 14, "news_days": 3, "filing_days": 7, "notified": {}}